# Invoice from a furniture workshop to a hotel. One A4 page with a logo, the details of the parties,
# a strip with the terms, the table of lines with their totals in the footer and the page
# footer in a Page overlay. All the styling is in styles.stxt: the elements carry only their content. The texts carry
# Markup: markdown to put a bold word inside the sentence, and the payment details also carry Code
# font: the IBAN and the BIC, as inline code, in the monospaced font. The labels are written as
# a normal sentence and the rules put them in uppercase (Case) and space them out (Letter spacing).
# Next to the payment details, the transfer QR code that banking apps read (the EPC format: beneficiary, IBAN,
# amount and reference, one per line): a Barcode with its data in a Content block.
Document (dev.stxt.pdf):
	Page:
		Paper: A4
		Margin: 44 44 60 44
	Title: Invoice 2025-0147
	Language: en
	Section:
		Page overlay:
			Id: footer
			Offset: auto 0 -34 0
			Box:
				Padding: 6 0 0 0
				Border: 0.5 0 0 0
				Border color: #DCCFB8
			Stack:
				Horizontal: justify
				Item:
					Text: Taller Nogal S.L. · Registered in the Girona Commercial Register, volume 2217, folio 88
				Item:
					Text: Page {page} of {pages}
		Stack:
			Id: masthead
			Horizontal: justify
			Vertical: center
			Box:
				Margin: 0 0 30 0
			Item:
				Image: examples/brand/nogal.svg
					Alt: Nogal, furniture workshop
					Box:
						Width: 172
			Item:
				Block:
					Text: Invoice
						Typography:
							Size: 28
							Bold: true
							Color: #3B2A1E
							Align: right
							Line height: 30
							Case: uppercase
							Letter spacing: 2
					Text: No. 2025-0147
						Typography:
							Size: 12
							Color: #A65C1B
							Align: right
		Grid:
			Id: parties
			Column sizes: * *
			Gap: 18
			Box:
				Margin: 0 0 18 0
			Area:
				Block:
					Style: party
					Text: From
						Style: label
					Text: Taller Nogal S.L.
						Style: strong
					Text: Tax ID B-17482930
					Text: Carrer de la Farga, 14 · Polígono Les Torres
					Text: 17800 Olot (Girona)
					Text: administracion@tallernogal.example
						Link: mailto:administracion@tallernogal.example
			Area:
				Block:
					Style: party
					Text: Bill to
						Style: label
					Text: Hotel Mirador del Valle, S.A.
						Style: strong
					Text: Tax ID A-08827416
					Text: Camí del Mirador, s/n
					Text: 17850 Besalú (Girona)
					Text: compras@miradordelvalle.example
						Link: mailto:compras@miradordelvalle.example
		Grid:
			Id: strip
			Column sizes: repeat(4, *)
			Box:
				Margin: 0 0 22 0
				Padding: 9 14
				Border: 0.5 0 0.5 0
				Border color: #A65C1B
			Area:
				Block:
					Text: Issue date
						Style: label
					Text: October 14, 2025
			Area:
				Block:
					Text: Due date
						Style: label
					Text: November 13, 2025
			Area:
				Block:
					Text: Payment method
						Style: label
					Text: Bank transfer, 30 days
			Area:
				Block:
					Text: Order
						Style: label
					Text: PO-2025-311
		Table:
			Id: lines
			Column sizes: 54 * 38 64 94
			Column align: left left right right right
			Box:
				Margin: 0 0 24 0
			Header rows:
				Row:
					Cell: Ref.
					Cell: Description
					Cell: Qty
					Cell: Price
					Cell: Amount
			Body:
				Row:
					Cell: MN-014
					Cell: Solid walnut dining table, 180 × 90 cm
						Row header: true
					Cell: 6
					Cell: €640.00
					Cell: €3,840.00
				Row:
					Cell: MN-022
					Cell: Oak chair with rush seat
						Row header: true
					Cell: 24
					Cell: €118.00
					Cell: €2,832.00
				Row:
					Cell: MN-031
					Cell: Modular wall shelving, five shelves
						Row header: true
					Cell: 8
					Cell: €215.00
					Cell: €1,720.00
				Row:
					Cell: MN-040
					Cell: Upholstered entryway bench
						Row header: true
					Cell: 4
					Cell: €189.50
					Cell: €758.00
				Row:
					Cell: MN-057
					Cell: Oval mirror with walnut frame, 70 × 100 cm
						Row header: true
					Cell: 12
					Cell: €96.00
					Cell: €1,152.00
				Row:
					Cell: SV-001
					Cell: Delivery and on-site assembly (two fitters, one day)
						Row header: true
					Cell: 1
					Cell: €480.00
					Cell: €480.00
				Row:
					Cell: SV-004
					Cell: Natural oil and beeswax finish
						Row header: true
					Cell: 1
					Cell: €260.00
					Cell: €260.00
			Footer rows:
				Row:
					Cell: Taxable base
						Row header: true
						Span: 1 4
					Cell: €11,042.00
				Row:
					Cell: VAT (21%)
						Row header: true
						Span: 1 4
					Cell: €2,318.82
				Row:
					Style: total
					Cell: Total due
						Row header: true
						Span: 1 4
					Cell: €13,360.82
		Grid:
			Id: payment
			Column sizes: * *
			Gap: 18
			Area:
				Stack:
					Gap: 12
					Item:
						Grow: 1
						Block:
							Typography:
								Markup: markdown
								Code font: IBM Plex Mono
							Text: Payment details
								Style: label
							Paragraph: **`ES91 2100 0418 4502 0005 1332`**
							Paragraph: Caixa Girona · BIC `CAIXESBBXXX`
							Paragraph: Include the **invoice number** in the payment reference.
					Item:
						Barcode:
							Id: payment-qr
							Alt: QR code to pay the invoice by transfer: €13,360.82 to Taller Nogal S.L.
							Box:
								Width: 76
							Content >>
								BCD
								002
								1
								SCT
								CAIXESBBXXX
								Taller Nogal S.L.
								ES9121000418450200051332
								EUR13360.82


								Invoice 2025-0147
			Area:
				Block:
					Text: Terms
						Style: label
					Paragraph: The furniture remains the property of the workshop until the invoice is paid in full. **Five-year** warranty on frame and hardware; solid wood may vary slightly in tone, as befits a living material.
						Typography:
							Size: 8
							Color: #5C4E43
							Markup: markdown
